{"id": "q0002", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1165022308, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": -1, "query": "Aiden is making his famous steakhouse-seasoned meatballs for a neighborhood cookout. He adds two tablespoons of his secret steakhouse seasoning for every pound of ground beef he uses. He gets sixteen meatballs from each pound of meat. If he wants to make 80 meatballs for the cookout, how much of his secret seasoning will he need?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0002.wav", "input_sha256": "fec12bcf750c0246a49dd7730c9816c40f1eb1a4633fc590eb361ac4309c3ce9", "input_samples": 387400, "input_s": 24.212, "n_real_chunks": 25, "score": 0.3591, "act": 0.9989, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So Aidan is making meatball s for a cookout, and he wants to know how much of his secret seasoning he needs. He uses 2 tablespoons per pound of ground beef, and each pound makes 16 meatballs. He wants 80 meat balls total. Let's figure out how much meat he needs first. If 1 pound gives him 1 6 meatballs, then to get 8 0 meatballs, we divide 80 by 16, which is 5 pounds of meat. Now that we know he needs 5 pounds of meat, we can calculate the season ing. Since he uses 2 tablespoons per pound, we multiply 5 pounds by 2 table spoons per pound, giving us 1 0 tablespoons of season ing. So A idan will need 1 0 tablespoons of his secret steak house seasoning.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "o